# oracle: create_bonds single/bond special yes with special_bonds lj 0 1 1: with special no native skips special.build(), so the new bond's pair (atoms 1 and 5, sqrt(2) apart) keeps its LJ term; with yes it is excluded
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-12 abs=1e-14
units lj
atom_style bond
lattice sc 1.0
region box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box 2 box bond/types 1 extra/bond/per/atom 6
create_atoms 1 box
mass * 1.0
pair_style lj/cut 1.5
pair_coeff * * 1.0 1.0
special_bonds lj 0 1 1
bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff 1 100.0 1.0
create_bonds single/bond 1 1 5 special yes
thermo_style custom step pe
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo 10
velocity all create 0.5 4567
fix 1 all nve
run 20
